?r=1483873571","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/9e/dd/49325_crt_YJj1U.jpg?r=1483873571","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/9e/dd/49325_crt_YJj1U.jpg?r=1483873571","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/9e/dd/49325_crt_YJj1U.jpg?r=1483873571"},"summary":"18歳。千年続く陽冥司の一族「端木家」の家元。\r\n陽冥司としての資質に恵まれ、9歳の頃に家元となる。\r\n強い霊力を持つ、沈着冷静の美形男子。普段は感情を表に出すタイプではないが、「影霊（えいれい）」として契約した楊敬華の前では喜怒哀楽を見せるようになっていく。","name":"端木熙","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"端木熙"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"纯假名","v":"たんもくき"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":2,"collects":3},"id":49325,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/37/a8/50535_crt_1t1T0.jpg?r=1485319717","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/37/a8/50535_crt_1t1T0.jpg?r=1485319717","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/37/a8/50535_crt_1t1T0.jpg?r=1485319717","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/37/a8/50535_crt_1t1T0.jpg?r=1485319717"},"summary":"18歳。\r\n10歳の頃、端木煕の婚約者となる。一族により決められたフィアンセではあるが、彼女は本気で端木煕に惚れている。\r\n本来のヤンチャな自己を捨て、家元である端木煕を支えるにふさわしい妻になろうと努力を続けているが・・・。","name":"秦诗瑶","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"秦诗瑶"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"纯假名","v":"しんしよう"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":50535,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/31/4b/50975_crt_pnoSs.jpg?r=1486225303","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/31/4b/50975_crt_pnoSs.jpg?r=1486225303","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/31/4b/50975_crt_pnoSs.jpg?r=1486225303","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/31/4b/50975_crt_pnoSs.jpg?r=1486225303"},"summary":"端木家の裏山に棲みつく千年の妖狐。かつて陽冥司家であった端木煕の父の影霊でもある。\r\nその父との約束により、端木煕を陰ながら見守り続けている。","name":"寅哲","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"寅哲"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"纯假名","v":"いんてつ"}]},{"ke